algorithms.pseudocode:
COMPILE(φ, Σ):
  1. Q ← {eval(φ)}
  2. worklist ← [eval(φ)]
  3. while worklist ≠ ∅:
       S ← worklist.pop()
       for each a ∈ Σ:
         S' ← leftDeriv(S, [a])
         if S' ∉ Q: Q ← Q ∪ {S'}; worklist.push(S')
  4. return DFA(Q, δ, init=eval(φ), out(S)=S(ε))

Complexity: O(|Q| × |Σ|)
